cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If Fabrikka is part of your research, please cite it as below."
title: "Fabrikka: multiplayer AI"
abstract: >-
  A room where a team and the AI agents its members already use work one
  problem together, live. The room is itself an MCP server, so any agent that
  speaks the Model Context Protocol joins with no plugin, and stays its
  owner's. Self-hosted, free software.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Aldunate
    given-names: Federico
repository-code: "https://github.com/fabrikkadotxyz/core"
url: "https://fabrikka.xyz"
license: AGPL-3.0-only
keywords:
  - multiplayer AI
  - AI agents
  - Model Context Protocol
  - MCP
  - collaboration
  - self-hosted
